# 纯文本归档统一使用 LF，避免不同平台换行差异造成整份文件重写
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Preserve final PDF bytes
*.pdf binary

# Preserve delivered TXT bytes (UTF-8, CRLF), matching the local ZIP.
txt/** -text

# Preserve the newly delivered PDF-folder catalogs and notices as well.
pdf/单语/** -text
pdf/双语/简中-英文（中上英下）/** -text
